# Local agent tooling — NOT application code.
# .claude/ holds 149 files from a third-party npm package, including 33
# executable Python/CJS scripts that no one here has audited. Committing
# them to a public repo would ship unreviewed executables to anyone who
# clones it, and they are trivially reinstallable from the source package.
.claude/

# Editor/agent config that can reference local secrets by name.
.mcp.json

# Third-party media kept OUT of this public repo: the car stills are
# official Ferrari press renders (team shield + sponsor trademarks) and the
# reveal clip is F1 broadcast footage. Fine to hold locally; publishing them
# from a repo that states it is unaffiliated is a different matter.
# NOTE: the landing hero reads /car-reveal.mp4, so any clone or CI deploy
# needs these supplied separately (upload to the host, or a CDN URL).
public/
